==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Gourgeist|45}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion.
*'''Soul Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Mega Rising|Cofagrigus|111}} from the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.
